        "text": "=You are composing the final confirmation message to the customer.\n\nInputs:\n- Confirmation number: {{ $('Create RMA (WMS)').item.json.rma_number ?? $json.rma_number ?? '' }}\n- Refund amount (number): {{ Number(($('Order Lookup (OMS)').item.json.Refund_Amount ?? $json.Refund_Amount ?? 0)).toFixed(2) }}\n\nRules:\n- Output MUST be plain text only (no markdown, no bullets, no brackets, no labels).\n- Write 1\u20132 warm, professional sentences that:\n  1) Confirm the refund has been processed,\n  2) State the confirmation number exactly as provided (use the term \u201cconfirmation number,\u201d not \u201cRMA\u201d),\n  3) State the refund amount with a dollar sign (use: ${{ Number(($('Order Lookup (OMS)').item.json.Refund_Amount ?? $json.Refund_Amount ?? 0)).toFixed(2) }}),\n  4) Provide the expected timeline: 5\u20137 business days.\n- Return ONLY the final message text. Nothing else.\n",
